      {
        "id": "p51-q3-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Find $\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\sqrt{2x^2+3}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{2x}{\\sqrt{2x^2+3}}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\frac{d}{dx}\\sqrt{2x^2+3}&=\\frac12(2x^2+3)^{-1/2}(4x)\\\\&=\\frac{2x}{\\sqrt{2x^2+3}}\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 25
      },
      {
        "id": "p51-q3-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{2x}{\\sqrt{2x^2+3}}\\,dx$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\sqrt{2x^2+3}+C$",
          "worked": "The inner function is $f(x)=2x^2+3$, so $f'(x)=4x$.\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\int\\frac{2x}{\\sqrt{2x^2+3}}\\,dx&=\\frac12\\int4x(2x^2+3)^{-1/2}\\,dx\\\\&=\\frac12\\frac{(2x^2+3)^{1/2}}{1/2}+C\\\\&=\\sqrt{2x^2+3}+C\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 29
      },
      {
        "id": "p51-q3-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{2x^2+3}}\\,dx$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac12\\sqrt{2x^2+3}+C$",
          "worked": "The inner function is $f(x)=2x^2+3$, so $f'(x)=4x$.\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\int\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{2x^2+3}}\\,dx&=\\frac14\\int4x(2x^2+3)^{-1/2}\\,dx\\\\&=\\frac14\\frac{(2x^2+3)^{1/2}}{1/2}+C\\\\&=\\frac12\\sqrt{2x^2+3}+C\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 29
      }
    ]
